## Language project data. Never committed here, in any form, for any reason.
## Motif operates on somebody else's project; it does not carry one. Every test that needs a live
## LcmCache builds a blank project from the SIL.LCModel package at run time and throws it away.
*.fwdata
*.fwdata.*
*.ldml
*.ldml.*
*.chm
WritingSystemStore/
TestLangProj/
## The one exception: synthetic conformance fixtures. Nobody's language lives in these; each is a
## grammar backed out into a LibLCM project by the Machine conformance suite, with its provenance in
## SOURCE.md beside it. The owner ruled that the rule above is about real project data, not these.
!tests/SIL.Motif.Tests/TestFixtures/Conformance/**/*.fwdata
!tests/SIL.Motif.Tests/TestFixtures/Conformance/**/WritingSystemStore/
!tests/SIL.Motif.Tests/TestFixtures/Conformance/**/*.ldml

## .NET build output
bin/
obj/

## IDE
.vs/
.vscode/
*.user
*.suo

## OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

## Exported Claude Code session transcripts (working notes, not documentation)
[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-*.txt
.tmp
docs/*.md.orig

# Agent worktrees: transient checkouts created by background subagents.
.claude/worktrees/

# PR preflight working summary; durable evidence belongs in the PR or docs.
.review/

# Python bytecode from running the Handoff reader in tests
__pycache__/
*.pyc
